      "@type": "FAQPage",
      mainEntity: [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is protein powder safe to take every day?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "For most healthy adults, yes, in normal amounts from a reputable, third-party tested brand. One or two scoops a day as part of a balanced diet is typical. Daily use does make contaminant levels matter more, so favor products that publish heavy metal testing, and talk to a doctor first if you have kidney disease or another chronic condition."
          }
