          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is protein powder safe during pregnancy?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It can be, but it deserves extra care. Protein needs rise during pregnancy, yet many people can meet them from food. If you use a powder, choose one with published heavy metal testing and no herbal extracts, stimulants or heavy fortification that could stack with a prenatal vitamin, and confirm the specific product with your obstetric provider or a registered dietitian."
          }
