          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What does NSF Certified for Sport mean?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It means NSF has screened the product for a long list of substances banned in sport, checked that the label claims match the contents, screened for contaminants and audited the manufacturing facility. It is the certification many professional and college sports organizations recognize. Always confirm the exact product and flavor in NSF's database, because listings change and logos can be misused."
          }
